GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/0x5c504ed432cb51138bcf09aa5e8a410dd4a1e204ef84bfed1be16dfba1b22061
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/0xnope

###
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions?page=2&pageSize=2

###
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions?page=asd&pageSize=3



### Filter: token
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions?token=USDC

### Filter: token, другой регистр
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions?token=usdc

### Filter: address (должен находить и From, и To)
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions?address=0xde0b295669a9fd93d5f28d9ec85e40f4cb697bae

### Filter: address в верхнем регистре
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions?address=0xDE0B295669A9FD93D5F28D9EC85E40F4CB697BAE

### Filter: status (проверь, что totalCount = числу элементов)
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions?status=Failed

### Filter: диапазон блоков
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions?fromBlock=21000002&toBlock=21000004

### Filter: комбинация
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions?token=USDT&status=Confirmed

### 400: fromBlock > toBlock
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions?fromBlock=100&toBlock=50

### 400: неизвестный статус
GET {{TxIndexer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions?status=Unknown


